   "text": "ENAE International Business School - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nENAE International Business School\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nAt ENAE Business School, we believe in the power of education to transform lives and drive progress. Established in Murcia, Spain, our institution has a rich history of providing high-quality business education to students from all walks of life. Our approach to business education is innovative and forward-thinking. We strive to stay at the cutting edge of the industry by incorporating the latest research and \ntechniques into our curriculum. \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 08:56\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 08:56\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nSpain\nYearly Fees\nMax: €15,000.00\nMin: €7,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n80%\n800 of 1,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1988\nCampus(es)\nMurcia\nCountry\nSpain\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n12/09/2023\nContract End Date\n17/09/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nExpiring in 60 days\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.enae.es/alumnos/financiacion-becas-y-bonificacion?_adin=01833301559\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=inwv4SMhwWg\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.enae.es/alumnos/practicas-en-empresas?_adin=01833301559\nAdditional Information\n-",
